flowchart LR
    User[Field researcher]

    subgraph Device[React Native device - Android verified, iOS incomplete]
        App[Off Grid mobile app]
        Camera[Camera and photo library]
        Location[Location services]
        Native[Native image preprocessing]
        ORT[ONNX Runtime]
        Files[(Device files)]
        SQLite[(SQLite)]
        State[(Persisted UI state)]

        User --> App
        App --> Camera
        App --> Location
        App --> Native --> ORT
        App --> Files
        App --> SQLite
        App --> State
    end

    Identity[External identity provider]
    ArtifactAPI[External model and pack API]
    ObservationAPI[External observation API]
    ArtifactStore[Signed artifact downloads]
    PhotoStore[Signed photo upload target]
    Catalog[External research catalog]

    App -->|sign in| Identity
    App -->|latest model and pack metadata| ArtifactAPI
    ArtifactAPI -->|short-lived download URL| ArtifactStore
    App -->|download model or pack| ArtifactStore
    App -->|request upload and submit reviewed match| ObservationAPI
    ObservationAPI -->|short-lived upload URL| PhotoStore
    App -->|upload reviewed crop| PhotoStore

    ObservationAPI -. integration outside this repository .-> Catalog

